description:
The United Kingdom's 2025 Eurovision Song Contest act, Remember Monday perform a special acoustic version of their song 'What The Hell Just Happened?' at their Afternoon Tea press event at the Theatre Royal in Drury Lane, London on Monday 24th March 2025. ESC Covers attended the event, and we bring you the fantastic harmonies from the girls in this live acoustic version!

@remembermonday_ 

